## Decisions Made

- **Single source of truth = `provider.id` in Plan body** (TD-44 α). Animator's vocab («seedance-standard») maps to both providerImpl AND qualityTier via `resolveVanimProviderId()`. Closes the silent drift between Animator intent and VGEN runtime.
- **planIntent as opt-in arg, legacy testPlan as fallback** (TD-38 β). Non-plan-driven path (replay-pilot, legacy fixtures) unchanged — `planIntent: undefined` → `formatTestPlanText` runs as before.
- **`audio_tracks.length > 0` before fallback short-circuit** (audio fix). Empty array no longer counts as «I have tracks» — falls back to `music_url`.
- **One-provider-per-episode for SS-S15-E01** (q49 directive). Director chose Seedance lock; Veo deferred. Animator picks fast vs standard per shot from extended allowlist.
- **Director's 10/10/10 brief format** (cause / hypothesis / fix in 10-word increments). Codified as preference in MEMORY.md. Director: «давай попробуем в таком формате».
- **TD-43 delivered as 3 surfaces** (A drawer / B preview / C timeline kebab). Director's original intent was «hover on cell number» — TD-43.C is closest. A+B are bonuses for drawer-based navigation.
- **Hover-gap = `top-0` (no offset)** for TD-43.C popover. Touching edges = no mouseLeave glitch.

